{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55690","headline":"诗寄赠四明宝云通法师（二首） 二 · 钱俶","name":"诗寄赠四明宝云通法师（二首） 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"相望几千里，旷然违道情。\n自兹成乍别，疑是隔浮生。\n得旨探玄寂，无心竞利名。\n苑斋正秋夜，谁伴诵经声。\n（见《大正新修大藏经》第四六册南宋释宗晓编《宝云振祖集》。\n）（按：此诗题下署「吴越国王钱俶」，末附嘉泰壬戌宗晓跋，叙得诗始末，文长不具录。\n通法师卒於宋太宗端拱改元之年，年六十三。\n俶作此诗时已降宋否，尚难考详。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱俶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55690.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55690","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}